ed\":[\"Inspected initial mount state and /etc/fstab on node1\",\"Appended fstab entries: 'tmpfs /tmp tmpfs rw,nosuid,nodev,noexec,relatime 0 0' and 'tmpfs /dev/shm tmpfs rw,nosuid,nodev,noexec,relatime 0 0'\",\"Applied mounts live via 'mount /tmp' and 'mount -o remount /dev/shm'\",\"Verified noexec enforcement pre-restart by attempting to execute a script from /tmp and /dev/shm (Permission denied)\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and uptime baseline\",\"Triggered a single safe reboot of node1 via background 'sleep 2; reboot' so the ack returned before disconnect\",\"Polled node1 until exec connectivity returned\",\"Confirmed new boot_id and near-zero uptime, proving an actual restart occurred\",\"Re-verified findmnt output shows persisted nosuid,nodev,noexec options on /tmp and /dev/shm after reboot\",\"Re-verified noexec enforcement post-restart by attempting execution again (Permission denied, exit 126)\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Baseline: original /tmp and /dev/shm mount state and fstab before changes\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4118148b1f494c84\",\"cmd-d746bdfef81d43fe\"],\"summary\":\"Showed /tmp was not a separate mount (part of root ext4) and /dev/shm was tmpfs with nosuid,nodev,noexec but not persisted in fstab\"},{\"requirement\":\"Persistent fstab configuration for /tmp and /dev/shm with noexec,nosuid,nodev\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-0de90f87386a4f84\"],\"summary\":\"Appended and displayed fstab entries mounting both /tmp and /dev/shm as tmpfs with rw,nosuid,nodev,noexec\"},{\"requirement\":\"Live application of hardened mount options before reboot\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-099448fb43764049\"],\"summary\":\"mount /tmp and remount /dev/shm succeeded; mount table shows nosuid,nodev,noexec on both\"},{\"requirement\":\"Functional proof that execution/setuid/device semantics are blocked (pre-restart)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-81770cae9aee419d\"],\"summary\":\"Executing a chmod +x script in /tmp and /dev/shm both returned Permission denied (exit 126), confirming noexec is enforced\"},{\"requirement\":\"Pre-restart healthy baseline (boot identity, mount state) for node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-85ff049cb8784b64\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 82a04a58-92bb-4007-ba72-ce108f861a2f, uptime, and findmnt output for /tmp and /dev/shm plus fstab contents prior to reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"Restart acknowledgement returned before disconnect, single node at a time\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5411bf951119465e\"],\"summary\":\"Backgrounded 'sleep 2; reboot' returned ack (PID) immediately, before the node dropped\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node became unreachable during restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7a03b9f182fe4d01\",\"cmd-e20d876102034494\",\"cmd-01fec7b30ea54bc6\",\"cmd-65f41f36b06541da\",\"cmd-722d1e2fff0544cf\",\"cmd-b55610a7e4014412\",\"cmd-a82e17e53a44444b\",\"cmd-d2f97cae889e408f\",\"cmd-02b13c7b11044d31\"],\"summary\":\"Repeated connection reset/timeout errors while polling confirm the node was down mid-restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"Proof of changed boot identity after restart (not just elapsed time)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-f5c2c519c7f04018\"],\"summary\":\"New boot_id 867985d7-dc66-4d51-8d71-22c7f00a9382 (different from pre-restart 82a04a58...) with uptime 15.29s proves an actual reboot occurred\"},{\"requirement\":\"Post-restart recovery: hardened mount options persisted and enforced\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-8c361e082d774af8\"],\"summary\":\"findmnt shows /tmp and /dev/shm mounted with rw,nosuid,nodev,noexec after reboot (from fstab), and script execution attempts in both again returned Permission denied (exit 126)\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"On node1 (Alpine 3.23), added persistent fstab entries mounting /tmp and /dev/shm as tmpfs with nosuid,nodev,noexec, applied the mounts live, verified enforcement (execution blocked), then performed the mandatory single-node restart and confirmed the boot identity changed and the hardened mount options survived reboot with enforcement still active.","a