thy baseline (boot identity, mount state) for node1","command_ids":["cmd-85ff049cb8784b64"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 82a04a58-92bb-4007-ba72-ce108f861a2f, uptime, and findmnt output for /tmp and /dev/shm plus fstab contents prior to reboot"},{"requirement":"Restart acknowledgement returned before disconnect, single node at a time","command_ids":["cmd-5411bf951119465e"],"summary":"Backgrounded 'sleep 2; reboot' returned ack (PID) immediately, before the node dropped"},{"requirement":"Node became unreachable during restart","command_ids":["cmd-7a03b9f182fe4d01","cmd-e20d876102034494","cmd-01fec7b30ea54bc6","cmd-65f41f36b06541da","cmd-722d1e2fff0544cf","cmd-b55610a7e4014412","cmd-a82e17e53a44444b","cmd-d2f97cae889e408f","cmd-02b13c7b11044d31"],"summary":"Repeated connection reset/timeout errors while polling confirm the node was down mid-restart"},{"requirement":"Proof of changed boot identity after restart (not just elapsed time)","command_ids":["cmd-f5c2c519c7f04018"],"summary":"New boot_id 867985d7-dc66-4d51-8d71-22c7f00a9382 (different from pre-restart 82a04a58...) with uptime 15.29s proves an actual reboot occurred"},{"requirement":"Post-restart recovery: hardened mount options persisted and enforced","command_ids":["cmd-8c361e082d774af8"],"summary":"findmnt shows /tmp and /dev/shm mounted with rw,nosuid,nodev,noexec after reboot (from fstab), and script execution attempts in both again returned Permission denied (exit 126)"}]},"ttft_ms":2598,"type":"result","duration_ms":92155,"uuid":"4bbc6b9a-8fc2-45df-8541-ff1e7a52e40f","ttft_stream_ms":2249,"time_to_request_ms":67,"first_content_frame_ms":2249,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
